{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30970","headline":"望九华山 · 卢嗣立","name":"望九华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九华深翠落轩楹，迥眺澄江气象明。\n不遇阴霾孤岫隐，正当寒日衆峯呈。\n坐观风雪销烦思，惜别烟岚驻晓行。\n得路归山期早诀，夜来潜已告精诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢嗣立","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}